# Two identities, one person. The 44 commits under the GitHub noreply address
# were made from a machine where the account default had not been overridden,
# and `git log --format='%an %ae' | sort -u` returning two lines on a solo
# entry reads like a collaborator who is not credited anywhere. This is git's
# own mechanism for saying they are the same author; no history was rewritten
# to say it.
